{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16208660","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620866001:0":{"text":"휴우... 드디어 전부 처리했네!","source_cn":"呼……总算都解决掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8F6E4CF01409A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620866002:1":{"text":"이번엔 시작하자마자 전투가 벌어졌네. 그래도 강한 마물들이 아니라서 다행이야.","source_cn":"没想到这次跑团一上来就是战斗环节，好在魔物还不算太难解决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D42F22A9706ECCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620866003:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620866004:1":{"text":"카세디아, 왜 그래? 어디 다쳤어?","source_cn":"科丝蒂，你怎么了？是哪里受伤了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9217FF9105669B6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620866005:1":{"text":"...아, 아니야. 난 괜찮아. 그런데 마물들이 좀 이상한 것 같지 않아?","source_cn":"……啊，不，我很好。不过你们有没有觉得，这些魔物有些古怪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE471EA285BD3B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620866006:3":{"text":"보통 마물이 인간에게 강한 공격성을 보이기는 하지만, 목적이 분명하고 대규모로 마을을 습격하는 경우는 드물어.","source_cn":"通常来说，魔物虽然对人类有很强的攻击性，但很少出现像这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF680C2CFCE423106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620866007:0":{"text":"마물이 하우스타운을 공격하는 건 분명 어떤 이유가 있을 거야...","source_cn":"魔物对豪斯镇的袭击，背后或许有什么特别的诱因……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36021F66D0D84D1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1620866007":{"text":"마물이 하우스타운을 공격하는 건 분명 어떤 이유가 있을 거야...","source_cn":"魔物对豪斯镇的袭击，背后或许有什么特别的诱因……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36021F66D0D84D1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620866008:3":{"text":"모험가 여러분, 도와주셔서 감사합니다. 하우스타운을 구해주셨군요.","source_cn":"各位冒险家，感谢你们出手相助，从邪恶的魔物手中救下了豪斯镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E2725AF2A5CF98D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620866009:0":{"text":"마을 주민 모두가 모험가님들께 깊이 감사하고 있습니다. 보잘것없지만 작은 축하 연회를 준비했으니, 부디 잠시 시간을 내어 함께해 주시겠습니까?","source_cn":"镇民们都非常感谢你们，想要为你们准备一场小型的庆功宴，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E64EDA903E5AD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620866010:0":{"text":"축하 연회라... 사건의 진상을 조사할 절호의 기회야.","source_cn":"庆功宴……这是个调查真相的好机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2316ADADFB9776B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620866011:0":{"text":"연회라면 자연스레 주민들을 한자리에 모을 수 있어. 게다가 분위기에 취해 경계심이 느슨해진 틈을 타면, 평소보다 더 많은 정보를 캐낼 수 있겠지.","source_cn":"宴会既能直接将镇民都聚集起来，方便询问；又更容易让人敞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4A74DD8F9B0D2AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620866012:1":{"text":"실벤, 또 춤으로 사람들을 설득하려는 거야?","source_cn":"休，你又要用跳舞的方式来说服他们了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6CFE7DEC258EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620866013:0":{"text":"크흠! 그건 뭐, 필요하다면야...","source_cn":"咳咳！看情况吧，如果需要的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x975FE3DE2761A5A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1620866013":{"text":"크흠! 그건 뭐, 필요하다면야...","source_cn":"咳咳！看情况吧，如果需要的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x975FE3DE2761A5A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620866014:0":{"text":